  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Hellfire pours down in a 20-foot-radius, 40-foot-high Cylinder centered on a point within range. Until the spell ends, you can take a Magic action on your later turns to move the Cylinder up to 60 feet.</p><p>When the Cylinder appears, each creature in it makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 3d8 Fire damage on a failure or half as much on a success. A creature also makes this save when the area moves into its space, and when it enters the area or ends its turn there, but no more than once per turn.</p><p>You have Advantage on spell attack rolls against a creature in the Cylinder, and you deal an extra 1d6 Necrotic damage to it if you hit.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> The Fire damage increases by 1d8 for each spell slot level above 3.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-zypqv206z5G1V2Bg\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Use <em>Hellfire</em> when one of your spell attacks hits a creature in the Cylinder; give yourself the Advantage by hand.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
